<title>USA: New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - October 21.</title>
<headline>New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - October 21.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ORE - Comanesti 150,000 long tons ore Ponta da Madeira/Rotterdam 28/10-5/11 $4.65 six days Rohstoffhandel.</p>
<p>Ocean Conqueror 130,000 long tons ore Puerto Bolivar/Rotterdam 10-25/11 $5.10 six days Ocean Bulk.</p>
<p>Hassbat Qatar 125,000 long tons ore Port Cartier/Rotterdam 15-30/11 $3.80 six days Rohstoffhandell.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, +1 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
